    </section>
    
    <!-- 推荐排行榜 -->
    
    <!-- Top Categories / Topic Links -->
    <section id="topic-links" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">按需求选择机场</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">根据您的使用习惯、预算和客户端，探索细分领域的优质节点推荐。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <a href="/blog/stable-airports/" class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center group"><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">稳定机场推荐</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">晚高峰不卡顿的高端选择</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/cheap-airports/" class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">便宜机场推荐</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">高性价比与平价套餐</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/iplc-iepl-airports/" class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">专线机场推荐</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">IPLC / IEPL 内网专线</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/pay-as-you-go-airports/" class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">按量计费机场</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">不限时流量包 / 备用节点</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/clash-best-airports/" class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">Clash 机场推荐</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">完美兼容 Clash / Verge</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/shadowrocket-airports/" class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">Shadowrocket 机场</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">小火箭一键导入支持</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/ai-chatgpt-airports/" class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">ChatGPT 机场</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">AI 解锁 / 原生 IP 节点</p>
